    "descriptionModule": {
      "briefSummary": "The study is a Phase 2, multi-center, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study to evaluate the effects of tibulizumab over 16 weeks (Period 1) in adults with hidradenitis suppurativa, followed by a 16-week open-label extension period in which all participants will receive tibulizumab (Period 2)"
    },
